Description:
  jellyfish is a Python library supporting a number of fuzzy string matching
  metrics. It can be used to support suggestions for mistyped commands or
  related options in our tooling.
  Revision is from `git merge-base JIRI_HEAD origin/upstream/0.10.x`.

Local Modifications:
  Added README.fuchsia.
  Added BUILD.gn.
  Added METADATA.textproto
  Added OWNERS
  Added stubs/ with Fuchsia-authored mypy type stubs for jellyfish._jellyfish.
  Checked out tag v0.10.1.
